Subject: [M156] [Passwords] Key classifier model predictions by DriverId

Original change's description:
> [Passwords] Key classifier model predictions by DriverId
>
> A cross-document navigation can reuse the frame's RenderFrameHost
> (e.g. when leaving the initial empty document), so the
> ContentPasswordManagerDriver is reused too.
> Key PasswordManager's classifier model predictions by DriverId instead
> of the driver pointer, which may be reused by a different driver.
>
